title: The Police at Dawn
subtitle: A district office is searched.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('raid'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('raid');
// the district's own leader may be taken in the raid
Q.lw_n = 0;
if (Q.lw_dc_has && Math.random() < 0.5) {
    Q.lw_n = 1;
    RG.arrest(Q.lw_dc, RG.lw.rnd(3, 5), {news: Q.lw_dc_name + ' arrested in a raid in ' + Q.lw_town, priority: 2});
} else {
    RG.news('Police raid the communist office in ' + Q.lw_town, 2);
}
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 3, loyalty: -2});
!}

= The Police at Dawn

At five in the morning, the political police break down the door of the party office in **[+ lw_town +]**, in [+ lw_d_name +]. They take the card index of the members, two typewriters, the duplicating machine and a box of leaflets that had not yet been distributed. [? if lw_n = 1 : They also take **[+ lw_dc_name +]**, who had slept on the sofa in the back room. ?]

By eight, a crowd has gathered outside. The officer in charge tells the reporters that he has found evidence of a plot. The reporters print it.

The card index holds [+ lw_d_members +] thousand names, and every one of them now has a file.

- @warn: Warn every comrade in the card index.
- @stoppage: Call a protest stoppage in the works.
- @lawyers: Sue for the files and the machines.
- @deputies: Raise it in parliament.

@warn
subtitle: Members at risk are protected; some of them quietly leave. The Spartacist way: the organisation first.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {members: -0.04, loyalty: 5, repression: -4});
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 3);
!}

Couriers on bicycles reach every name within two days. Comrades who work for the railways or the post office take a holiday, and some never come back from it. The rest know where they stand.

@stoppage
subtitle: If the works stop, the police will think twice. If they do not, the police will know it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lw_d_mil >= 50 || Math.random() < 0.3) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -7, militancy: 4});
    Q.worker_support += 2;
    RG.news('Works in ' + Q.lw_town + ' stop work against the police raid');
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 5, members: -0.03});
}
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 3);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : At ten the sirens go at [+ lw_works +], and the works empties into the street. By the afternoon, the police president is talking about a misunderstanding. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : A few hundred come out. The police photograph every one of them from the roof opposite. ?]

@lawyers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The courts slow the police down. The Right's way: use the Republic's own laws.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -8});
if (Q.lw_n == 1 && Math.random() < 0.5) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.free(Q.lw_dc);
}
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 3);
!}

The party's lawyers file a complaint for every door broken without a warrant. [? if lw_out = 1 : A judge in [+ lw_town +] finds the arrest of [+ lw_dc_name +] unlawful and orders a release. ?][? if lw_out = 0 : The typewriters come back after six weeks. The card index does not. ?]

@deputies
subtitle: The raid becomes a scandal. Worker support grows; the social democrats are embarrassed.
view-if: kpd_seats > 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.spd_relation -= 2;
Q.stability -= 1;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -4});
RG.news('Communist deputies demand an inquiry into the ' + Q.lw_town + ' raid', 2);
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 2);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 1);
!}

Our deputies read out the inventory of the search, item by item, to a half-empty chamber: two typewriters, one duplicating machine, three hundred leaflets about the price of bread. The plot is never mentioned again.
